  "description": "The Sutra SE is a steel touring bike for riders who know exactly what they want: comfort, durability, and a dependable companion for long-haul touring, bikepacking, and everyday miles. Its Kona Cromoly frame delivers the smooth, steady ride that keeps loaded trips comfortable, while PNW-proven mountain bike DNA brings confident handling and burly reliability when the road gets rough or the weather turns ugly. This is the full album, not the single—built for riders who measure routes in days and know the best tours rarely stick to the setlist. Pack the bags, press play, and enjoy the ride front to back.",
